    },
    "You will use TW FiDO to retrieve your National ID data, and create a valid document." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你將使用行動自然人憑證，從MyData取得自己的數位身分資料，建立一張正式證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your credentials, the source documents, and your device key will be deleted. The next document you create will use a new identifier and cannot be linked to the current one. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的憑證、原始文件與裝置金鑰都會被刪除。之後重新建立的證件會使用全新的識別碼，無法與目前這一個連結起來。此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
